    "updated_at": "2016-08-23T08:59:00Z",
    "body": "I had been trying in Canary, but not using `Reflect.construct()`. The current Chrome documentation states that it will reject any constructor that returns a different object, so I believed that using the constructor as a factory wasn't a possibility.\n\nI'm on a Chromebook while traveling, so can't easily test flagged features at the moment, but will check on my Windows box when I get home. Thanks!\n",
