    "created_at": "2016-08-23T18:28:07Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-08-23T18:28:07Z",
    "body": "Closing, since as @rniwa noted this is not a support forum, and there is no spec bug being reported here.\n\nEveryone should remember that every browser that implements custom elements also implements ES6 class syntax, with super(). The features are designed to work together and there is no desire to make things work with ES5 syntax or with older browsers, since the specification is made for newer browsers.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
